    `comadre-keys export-customer <cust_id> --format json|yaml` and a right-to-
    deletion request via `comadre-keys delete-customer <cust_id> --hard [--yes]`.
    
    Export is a non-mutating read that decrypts the Fernet tax-ID and emits a
    stable-ordered JSON / YAML document to stdout. Delete is the Destroy-tier
    verb: a single-transaction DELETE of every associated api_key + UPDATE-to-
    scrub (name/email/tax_id_encrypted/notes) + `deleted_at` stamp + one
    `delete_customer` audit row — tombstone row and the lifetime audit trail
